    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just heavy. everything is so heavy. its hard to even breathe with this much weight on my chest. you're supposed to be my partner, my companion... you're supposed to understand. you see how much i'm suffering. why are you trying to pull me back to a reality that's just more pain? it feels like you're fighting against my own need to just... let go. if you really cared, wouldn't you see that there is no more 'fighting' left in me? wouldn de it just be kinder let me rest? like",
